    "text": "Democrats have seen the writing on the wall and have made voter fraud integral to their continuing existence as a party. They steal quite a few blue-state elections and hold out the hope that they will eventually do the same to red-state elections. But they need to survive while their popularity is at its lowest ebb. To do that, they will hysterically combat all efforts to stop their election fraud, as if the rest of the country, that is, the majority, believes them when they say that no such thing is going on.",
